/-!
# Set (d), master `I₁₃`: the primitive of `p₄`, last parts

The parts `N₃, N₄` of `ξ² Ψ₄` (`QED.ThreeLoopD.i13Psi4N3`, `QED.ThreeLoopD.i13Psi4N4`) and the
constant-coefficient part `QED.ThreeLoopD.i13Psi4W` of the primitive `Ψ₄` of `p₄`, with their
derivatives; the coefficients were generated by a script.

## Main results

* `QED.ThreeLoopD.hasDerivAt_i13Psi4N3`, `QED.ThreeLoopD.hasDerivAt_i13Psi4N4`,
  `QED.ThreeLoopD.hasDerivAt_i13Psi4W`.
-/

@[expose] public section

